        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche ilayiok le Israel, Ruben, o Simion o Lawi, o Yuda, o Isaakar, o Sebulon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Dan, o Yosef, o Benchamen, o Naftali, o Gaad, o Asheri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulo ninche ilayiok le Yuda. Eer, o Onan, o Shela, ore kulo pokira okuni apa etoikio Betshua oo Lkanaani ninye. Ore apa Eer ilo kikau le Yuda naa oltung'ani arruoni te dukuya Olaitoriani. Neaku etara Olaitoriani ninye metua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina tito apa nayama olayioni lenye naji Tamar, neiki ninye Peres o Serak. Eeta apa Yuda ilayiok imiet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche ilayiok le Peres: Hesron o Hamul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Serak naa Simri, o Etan, o Hemian, o Kalkol o Dara, imiet pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 7.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kulo ninche ilayiok le Kormi; Akar ilo aing'oling'olani loo Siraeli, laa ninye apa otigila nkitanapat too ntokitin naaitisinyakaki Enkai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore olayioni le Etan naa Asaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Entalipa olmarei lo laiguanani Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ayiok apa etoikioki Hesron: Yerameel, o Ram, o Kelubia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram apa menye le Aminadab, naa Aminadab apa menye le Nahashon, ilo kitok loo layiok le Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahashon apa menye le Salma, Salma le Boas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boas le Obed, Obed le Yese ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yese apa menye le Eliab naa ninye olkikau. Aminadab oliare, o Shimea aa ninye oliokuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natanel oliong'uan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Radai ole imiet, Osem ole ile ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oliopishana, ore nkanashera enye naa Seruyia, o Abigail. Ore ilayiok le Seruyia naa Abishai, o Yoab, o Asahel. Lelo pokira okuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etoiuo apa Abigail Amasa, ore menye le Amasa naa Yeter le Ishmael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Hesron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeta apa Kaleb olayioni le Hesron nkera naatoiuo enkitok enye naji Asuba, ore te Yeriot, naa kuna nkarn oo layiok lenyena, Yesher, o Shobab, o Adron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eye Asuba, neyam Kaleb Efarat naa ninye natoiuo Huri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huri apa menye le Uri naa Uri menye le Besalel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi nelo Hesron ayam entito e Makir, menye le Gilead. Neyamisho ninye aa oloo larin ntomoni ile, neiki ina tito ninye Segub. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa Segub apa menye le Yair, laa ninye apa oata nkanas tikitam ookuni te nkop e Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etaaraitie apa Geshur o Aram nkanas e Hofotajir, o Kenat, o nkang'itie enyena kutiti, nkang'itie ntomoni ile. Ore kuna pooki naa inoo le ishoi oo le Makir, menye le Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tesiadi te keeya e Hesron, nelo Kaleb ayiolou Efarata, enkitok e Hesron papaai lenye. Neiki ina kitok ninye Ashuri, menye le Tekoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Yerameel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche ilayiok le Yerameel ilo kikau le Hesron: Ram ilo kikau lenye, o Buna, o Oren o Osem o Ahija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeta sii apa Yerameel enkae kitok, naji enkarna enye Atara; naa ninye apa ngotonye e Onam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche ilayiok le Ram ilo kikau le Yerameel: Maas o Yamin o Eker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche ilayiok le Onam: Shamai o Yuda ore ilayiok le Shamai naa Nadab o Abishur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa enkarna enkitok e Abishur naa Abihail neiki Abishu Ababan o Molid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Nadab naa; Seled o Apaim, neye Selad meeta enkerai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Apaim naa Ishi, ore ilayiok le Ishi, naa Sheshan, ore ilayiok le Sheshan naa Ahalai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kulo ilayiok le Yada, olalashe le Shamai, o Yeter o Yonatan. Etua apa Yeter meeta enkerai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche ilayiok le Yonatan: Pelet o Sasa. Ore kulo naa ile ishoi e Yerameel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeta apa Sheshem ilayiok, ntoyie ake eeta. Neeta apa Sheshem Olmisiri rrindik oji enkarna enye Yerha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishooyo Sheshan ina tito enye meyama Yerha, orrindik lenye. Neiu ina tito Atai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atai apa menye le Natan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa Natan menye le Sabad. Sabad apa menye le Efla naa Efla menye le Obed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed apa menye le Yehu, naa Yehu menye le Asaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaria apa menye le Heles, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa Heles menye le Eleasa. Eleasa menye le Sismai naa Sismai menye le Shalum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalum menye le Yekemia naa Yekemia menye le Elishama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kulikae le ishoi e Kaleb",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche ilayiok le Kaleb ilo alashe le Yerameel: Marehash ilo kikau lenye, laa ninye menye le Sif, ore ilayiok le Maresha olkikau lenye naa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilayiok le Hebron: Kora, Tapua, o Rekem o Shema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shema apa menye le Raham, menye le Yorkeam; aa menye Shamai apa Rekem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulo ninche ilayiok le Shamai: Maon: naa Maon apa menye le Betsar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore sii apa Efa ina apiani e Kaleb, neiu Haran, o Mosa o Geses, naa Haran apa menye le Geses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Yehadai; Regem, o Yotam, o Gesham o Pelet o Efa, o Shaaf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Maaka ina apiani e Kaleb neiu Sheber o Tirhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etoiuo sii Shaaf menye le Madmana, o Shefa menye le Makbena o menye le Gibea; ore apa entito e Kaleb naa keji Aksa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo apa ileishoi e Kaleb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Huri ilo kikau le Efrata: Shobal menye le Kiriat-yearim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salma menye le Betlehem o Heref menye le Betgader. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeta apa Shobal menye le Kiriat jearim kulikae ayiok; Haroe laa ninye olpisiai loo lmonubot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilmareita loo Lkiriat-yearim naa Iltiriti, o Iputi, o Ilchumati o Imishirati, naa kulo eing'uaa Ilsoriti o Ilshitoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Solma: Betlehem o Lnetofari o Arot-bet-Yoab, o lpisia loo Lmahahati, o Lsori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore sii ilmareita loo laigerok apa oomanya Yabes, naa Iltirati o Ichimeat o Lsukati. Ore kulo naa Ilkeni apa ooetuo aaing'uaa Hamat, menye lolmarei le Rekab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
